# lfg-web env. Copy to web/.env.local (gitignored) for local overrides.
#
# The web app needs no required env vars. Runtime UI extensions are loaded by
# the server (see LFG_EXTENSIONS in the repo-root .env.example), not the client.
#
# Analytics for the embedded onboarding survey is not this app's concern: a
# framed document can't fire Umami itself (wrong origin, second visitor —
# see src/lib/embed-host-signal.ts), so it posts an `lfg:analytics` message up
# to the embedding host instead, and the host's own already-configured Umami
# tracker fires it. There is nothing to set here.
